# Legacy dumpstate HAL policy is intentionally disabled for Mocha.
#
# This device tree has no dumpstate HAL service declaration, init service,
# executable file_contexts entry, or debugfs file_contexts entries for the
# paths previously authorized here. In particular, the old rules referenced
# undefined types (including a duplicated debugfs_nvavp rule). Defining those
# types without confirming the runtime paths would leave the permissions
# ineffective or label unrelated debugfs nodes too broadly.
#
# If a Mocha dumpstate HAL is added later, restore a dedicated policy together
# with its service and executable mapping, then label only verified debugfs
# nodes and grant the minimum permissions needed by that implementation.
